<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 4: Avoidance Symptoms (DSM-5 Cluster C)</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">In the past month, how much were you bothered by&hellip;</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item6">6. Avoiding memories, thoughts, or feelings related to the stressful experience?</label>
        <select id="item6" name="cluster_c.item6_avoiding_memories_thoughts_feelings">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_c.item6AvoidingMemoriesThoughtsFeelings == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item7">7. Avoiding external reminders of the stressful experience (people, places, conversations, activities, objects, situations)?</label>
        <select id="item7" name="cluster_c.item7_avoiding_external_reminders">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_c.item7AvoidingExternalReminders == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
